  "limitations": {
    "ja": "Lanczos・Arnoldi：Ritz値と固有対残差の収束: 非再始動・小行列・分離した極端固有対の教材です。内部固有値、クラスタ、巨大な疎行列、強い非正規性、shift-invertやimplicitly restarted Arnoldiは対象外です。小さな固有対残差だけで非正規行列の固有値誤差の厳密上界とはしません。 Krylov固有値：クラスター部分空間と非正規感度: NumPyの射影コアとSciPyの密参照はLAPACK基盤を共有し得るため、全面的に独立なバックエンドとはしません。解析固有値と独立構成対照を併用します。再始動、内部固有値、大規模疎行列、普遍的な単調収束は対象外です。",
    "en": "Lanczos and Arnoldi: convergence of Ritz values and eigenpair residuals: Unrestarted small-matrix educational examples with separated extreme eigenpairs. Interior/clustered eigenvalues, very large sparse matrices, strong nonnormality, shift-invert and implicitly restarted Arnoldi are outside scope. A small eigenpair residual alone is not treated as a rigorous eigenvalue-error bound for nonnormal matrices. Krylov eigenvalues: cluster subspaces and nonnormal sensitivity: NumPy projected solves and SciPy dense references may share LAPACK infrastructure and are not claimed fully independent backends. Analytic eigenvalues and constructed controls provide additional checks. Restarting, interior eigenvalues, large sparse systems and universal monotonic convergence are outside scope."
  },
